  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Turn your phone into a fashion statement with the Luxury Bow Pearl Chain Phone Case. Designed with a chic faux-leather texture, oversized bow, and elegant pearl chain, this case blends style with practicality. The hand strap doubles as a decorative charm and provides a secure grip, making it perfect for both everyday use and special occasions. ✨ Features: • Elegant bow design with pearl chain detailing • Premium faux-leather texture for a classy finish • Protective, durable, and shock-resistant • Comfortable hand strap for secure grip & easy carrying • Available in Black & Beige – timeless and versatile shades • Compatible with multiple iPhone models Perfect for fashion lovers who want their phone case to match their outfit, vibe, and luxury lifestyle.",
  "description_html": "<div>Turn your phone into a fashion statement with the Luxury Bow Pearl Chain Phone Case. Designed with a chic faux-leather texture, oversized bow, and elegant pearl chain, this case blends style with practicality. The hand strap doubles as a decorative charm and provides a secure grip, making it perfect for both everyday use and special occasions.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>✨ Features:</div>\n<div><span> • Elegant bow design with pearl chain detailing</span></div>\n<div><span> • Premium faux-leather texture for a classy finish</span></div>\n<div><span> • Protective, durable, and shock-resistant</span></div>\n<div><span> • Comfortable hand strap for secure grip &amp; easy carrying</span></div>\n<div><span> • Available in Black &amp; Beige – timeless and versatile shades</span></div>\n<div><span> • Compatible with multiple iPhone models</span></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Perfect for fashion lovers who want their phone case to match their outfit, vibe, and luxury lifestyle.</div>"
